manipulation","combatStyle":"","limitations":["Runes were initially uncontrollable"],"powerSource":["Hochmeister bloodline","Great Runic Magic"],"abilityNotes":"The great runic magic passes through the male Hochmeister bloodline. Vorlag''s abilities remained dormant until the destruction of his family triggered their violent awakening at age twelve.","combatProfile":"Vorlag possesses powerful hereditary runic magic awakened through extreme trauma. His Runes of Dominion form the supernatural foundation of his authority and are central to the prophecy cultivated around him by The Church.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Runic Magic\nRunes of Dominion","secondaryAbilities":"","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Lean-muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Piercing blue"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Pale"],"wardrobe":"","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"","accessories":"","faceDetails":["Sharp jawline","Angular features","Strong brows"],"hairTexture":"","colorPalette":"","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"","appearanceNotes":"","outfitMaterials":"","postureMovement":["Regal","Controlled","Commanding"],"signatureOutfit":"","distinguishingFeatures":""},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:39:22.116779+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:39:28.418552+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing his family","Powerlessness","Failing to protect Theron","Losing control"],"goals":["Secure Shadowfen","Strengthen his rule","Fulfill his perceived destiny"],"beliefs":["Power ensures protection","Control prevents chaos","His runes mark his destiny","He is destined to rule"],"culture":"","lineage":"Hochmeister noble bloodline","storyArc":"Vorlag''s tragedy begins with a child desperate to protect his family and develops into a ruler who equates safety with absolute control. His vengeance and rise to power appear self-directed, but both were cultivated by The Church. The eventual truth behind his family''s massacre threatens the foundation of his identity, kingship, and belief in his destiny.","backstory":"At twelve, Vorlag returned with Vex, Corvin Sterling, and Alistar Vane to find the Hochmeister home engulfed in flames. Hearing his family trapped inside triggered the violent awakening of his inherited runic magic, forcing Vex to knock him unconscious before the uncontrolled eruption worsened. The massacre had secretly been engineered by The Church to awaken Vorlag''s power and advance a prophecy surrounding the Runes of Dominion. Church agents subsequently sheltered and trained him while directing his vengeance toward the nobles they had used as puppets. Vorlag eventually rose to kingship, married Isolde, established Shadowfen as his seat of power, and extended his influence into Ironspire Hold and the Lionheart Plains while remaining unaware of the full extent of The Church''s manipulation.","childhood":"Vorlag was born into a high-ranking noble family and displayed exceptional intellect from childhood. At age six, rival nobles stripped his family of its position and reduced them to commoners. He witnessed repeated humiliation and abuse directed toward his family and learned that openly resisting their aggressors could bring even greater retaliation.","lifestyle":["Royal governance","Military oversight","Runic training"],"storyRole":"Vorlag serves as the tyrannical King of Shadowfen while unknowingly remaining a central piece in The Church''s long-term plan. His rule, runic inheritance, and manipulated prophecy connect him to the artifact that Elias Thorne will eventually seek to protect.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Deep fear of helplessness","Obsessed with control","Protection through power","Unresolved family grief","Trauma-driven vigilance","Righteous self-justification"],"motivations":["Protect his family","Prevent future helplessness","Maintain absolute control","Fulfill the Dominion prophecy","Preserve Shadowfen"],"personality":["Intelligent","Calculating","Protective","Driven","Controlling","Ruthless","Traumatized","Determined","Suspicious"],"voiceSpeech":["Commanding","Controlled","Authoritative"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":"Born into House Hochmeister\nFamily stripped of noble status\nFamily reduced to commoners\nWitnessed repeated family abuse\nAttempted to defend his family\nHochmeister home burned\nFamily killed in the fire\nRunic magic awakened\nTaken in by The Church\nTrained by The Church\nHunted the responsible nobles\nFalsely accused of killing his family\nPursued the Dominion prophecy\nMarried Isolde\nBecame King\nEstablished Shadowfen"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":null,"relationships":{"allies":"Count Vex\nLord Corvin Sterling\nLord Alistar Vane","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"Isolde","children":"Theron","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Shadowfen\nIronspire Hold\nLionheart Plains","relationshipNotes":"Vex, Corvin Sterling, and Alistar Vane were Vorlag''s closest childhood friends and remained central figures in his rise. Vex helped keep him level-headed through cynical distraction, Corvin brought humor during their childhood, and Alistar provided intellectual and physical motivation. The Church later positioned itself as Vorlag''s benefactor while secretly having engineered the destruction of his family."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":null,"realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"959ee89b-1d60-47e4-b017-93d8ade67726","faction_record_id":"74fb0163-f452-4f7e-a9ea-13c15bb960db"}','2026-09-25T19:12:20.583307+00:00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id,entity_type,entity_id,entity_label,changed_by,changed_by_email,snapshot,created_at) VALUES ('e00c880a-256f-4952-9924-a8bba3743aac','studio_characters','263952e8-6fc5-4a74-845f-374026eaf29d','Cosmo','db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745','Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com','{"id":"263952e8-6fc5-4a74-845f-374026eaf29d","name":"Cosmo","media":{"tbdFields":"Eye color\nHeight\nWeight\nBirth date\nMother\nPartner","canonLocks":"Deep warm mahogany skin\nBlack 4C hair\nNeatly kept tight coils\nStrong defined features\nChiseled jawline\nHigh cheekbones\nTall muscular build\nSerious unwavering gaze\nAfrican-inspired clothing\nWolf ancestral symbolism\nDire Wolf Form\nUpright Sudoform\nCrystal-hardened fur","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Existing visual references establish Cosmo''s human appearance, upright sudoform, dire wolf form, and multiple crystal transformations.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nSudoform — Done\nBurmese Tourmaline Form — Done\nAmethyst Form — Done\nObsidian Form — Done\nRuby Form — Done\nEmerald Form — Done\nRaw Diamond Form — Done\nWulfenite Form — Done\nBlack Rainbow Titanium Quartz Form — Done\nSapphire Form — Done\nRose Quartz Form — Done\nCitrine Form — Done\nAura Quartz Form — Done\nMystic Topaz Form — Done\nDioptase Form — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain Cosmo''s established human design, African-inspired ancestral clothing, powerful physique, upright sudoform, dire wolf anatomy, and crystal-hardened fur across transformation references. Individual crystal forms should visually reflect the consumed material while preserving Cosmo''s recognizable silhouette and wolf anatomy.","referenceArtUrl":"","alternateFormUrl":""},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Late 20s","era":"","name":"Cosmo","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"Prince of Moonwood Vail\nHeir to Moonwood Vail","subrace":"Dire Wolf","summary":"Cosmo is King Kaelo''s eldest child and a disciplined royal heir of Moonwood Vail. Serious, resourceful, and intellectually minded, he carries responsibility with a controlled presence that reflects the immense dire wolf power beneath his calm exterior. Blessed by Terrax, he commands minerals and sand and can consume crystals to assume specialized crystalline forms.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Royal heir","affiliation":"Wolf Clan","apparentAge":"Late 20s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Physical strength\nDiscipline\nMineral control\nDefensive combat\nCombat adaptability\nCrystal versatility","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Shadow Boxing","Feints","Misdirection"],"limitations":["Crystal forms require consumed material"],"powerSource":["Dire Wolf physiology","Terrax''s blessing","Consumed crystals","Consumed gemstones"],"abilityNotes":"Cosmo can draw minerals from the earth and shape them into weapons and defensive crystal structures. He can manipulate sand into quicksand and animate it into duplicates of himself. His crystal assimilation ability lets him consume different crystals or gemstones and transform his body into corresponding crystalline forms.","combatProfile":"Cosmo combines disciplined physical combat with Shadow Boxing, smooth feints, and misdirection. His mineral and sand manipulation expands his battlefield control through weapons, crystalline defenses, quicksand, and animated sand duplicates. Crystal assimilation allows him to alter his body and dire wolf form according to the gemstone he has consumed.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Dire Wolf Form\nSudoform\nBurmese Tourmaline Form\nAmethyst Form\nObsidian Form\nRuby Form\nEmerald Form\nRaw Diamond Form\nWulfenite Form\nBlack Rainbow Titanium Quartz Form\nSapphire Form\nRose Quartz Form\nCitrine Form\nAura Quartz Form\nMystic Topaz Form\nDioptase Form","primaryAbilities":"Mineral Manipulation\nSand Manipulation\nCrystal Assimilation\nCrystal Transformation","secondaryAbilities":"Mineral Extraction\nMineral Weapon Creation\nCrystalline Defense\nQuicksand Creation\nSand Duplication","signatureTechniques":"Sand Duplicates\nCrystal Incasing","transformationDetails":"Cosmo possesses a dire wolf form and an upright humanoid sudoform. After consuming a compatible crystal or gemstone, he gains access to a transformation based on that material. His body becomes encased and hardened in the consumed crystal, including his dire wolf fur, which transforms into hardened crystalline fur. Each consumed material produces a visually distinct crystal form."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Muscular","Powerful"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":"","grooming":"Neatly maintained","skinTone":["Deep warm mahogany"],"wardrobe":"African-inspired royal clothing\nWolf ancestral regalia","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Neatly kept tight coils","accessories":"","faceDetails":["Chiseled jawline","High cheekbones","Strong defined features"],"hairTexture":["4C","Tightly coiled"],"colorPalette":"","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":["Dire Wolf Form","Sudoform","Burmese Tourmaline Form","Amethyst Form","Obsidian Form","Ruby Form","Emerald Form","Raw Diamond Form","Wulfenite Form","Black Rainbow Titanium Quartz Form","Sapphire Form","Rose Quartz Form","Citrine Form","Aura Quartz Form","Mystic Topaz Form","Dioptase Form"],"clothingStyle":"Traditional African-inspired royal attire incorporating ancestral wolf symbolism and designs suited to his position within Moonwood Vail.","appearanceNotes":"Cosmo''s human appearance emphasizes discipline and contained physical power. His dire wolf nature remains visually suggested through his commanding posture and ancestral clothing even before transformation.","outfitMaterials":"","postureMovement":["Controlled","Still","Commanding"],"signatureOutfit":"African-inspired royal clothing decorated with symbols honoring his wolf ancestors.","distinguishingFeatures":["Serious unwavering gaze","Rare grimace-like smile"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:37:36.786627+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:37:36.786627+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail","Wolf Clan"],"lineage":"Moonwood Vail royal family","storyArc":"","backstory":"Cosmo was born into King Kaelo''s royal family and raised beneath the responsibilities attached to Moonwood Vail''s Wolf Clan. He was blessed by Terrax, gaining control over minerals and sand. His supernatural physiology also allows him to consume crystals and gemstones and temporarily embody their crystalline properties.","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Cosmo is the eldest royal child of King Kaelo and heir to Moonwood Vail, carrying the responsibilities of leadership while developing his inherited and bestowed powers.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Burdened by responsibility","Emotionally restrained"],"motivations":["Protect his people","Honor his ancestors"],"personality":["Serious","Disciplined","Resourceful","Intellectual","Reserved","Responsible"],"voiceSpeech":["Few words","Controlled"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":"Blessed by Terrax"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":null,"relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Gemma\nCalliope\nHuxleigh\nPeregrine\nVenny''Claire\nVenny''Macon","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":""},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"615fa3ab-4f1d-47f0-b4f3-5e94e4fbf5fe","faction_record_id":"a289d101-2da7-4f15-bfba-51c034e5fda3"}','2026-09-25T19:15:51.089199+00:00');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO studio_revisions (id,entity_type,entity_id,entity_label,changed_by,changed_by_email,snapshot,created_at) VALUES ('923d8f8d-7c5d-44a7-8cc5-9f16ca47fa5f','studio_characters','34b16e35-6625-4143-b97b-a3b628d60617','Calliope','db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745','Bryannaparker2521@gmail.com','{"id":"34b16e35-6625-4143-b97b-a3b628d60617","name":"Calliope","media":{"tbdFields":"Mother\nBirth date\nHeight\nWeight\nDominant hand\nOccupation\nWeapons\nSignature techniques\nWeaknesses\nAbility limitations\nPartner\nStory role\nStory arc","canonLocks":"Female\nLate 20s\nKing Kaelo''s child\n4C hair\nThick long locs\nLioness/Dire Wolf hybrid\nTawny-gold werebeast coat\nDire wolf-like legs and paws\nFeminine werebeast form\nNo male lion mane\nMoonwood Vail","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Human-form character artwork and werebeast-form artwork are established visual references. The future Reference / Production Sheet should consolidate these designs into the primary visual canon reference.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Needed\nAlternate / True Form — Done\nFull-Body Front — Needed\nBack View — Needed\nLeft View — Needed\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Needed\nEye Reference — Needed\nHair Reference — Needed\nOutfit Breakdown — Needed\nExpression Sheet — Needed\nCombat Reference — Needed","productionNotes":"Preserve Calliope''s established anime/fantasy design across all future artwork. Her human form must retain the same facial structure, deep-brown skin, golden-amber eyes, black 4C locs, feminine athletic build, and dark-and-gold visual identity. Her werebeast form must remain a feminine lioness/dire wolf hybrid with a tawny-gold coat, powerful dire wolf-like legs and paws, and no male lion mane.","referenceArtUrl":"","alternateFormUrl":""},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Late 20s","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Calliope","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Female","titles":"","subrace":"Lioness/Dire Wolf Hybrid","summary":"Calliope is one of King Kaelo''s seven children. Fierce, intelligent, confident, and competitive, she carries herself with quiet authority and the controlled grace of a huntress. Her werebeast form combines the grace of a lioness with the powerful legs and heavy paws of a dire wolf.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"Late 20s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Physical Strength\nAgility\nSpeed\nPredatory Senses\nPouncing Power","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Predatory","Fluid","Close-range","Pounce-focused"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Werebeast physiology"],"abilityNotes":"","combatProfile":"Calliope fights with fluid, purposeful aggression modeled on a large hunting predator. Her werebeast form emphasizes explosive pounces, powerful limbs, heavy paws, claws, fangs, and close-range physical attacks.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Lioness/Dire Wolf Werebeast Form","primaryAbilities":"Werebeast Transformation\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Agility\nEnhanced Speed\nPredatory Senses","secondaryAbilities":"Natural Claws\nNatural Fangs\nPowerful Pounce","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"Calliope becomes a quadrupedal werebeast approximately the size of a full-grown lioness. Her form has a rich tawny-gold coat, lioness proportions, powerful dire wolf-like legs, and heavy paws. A thick shaggy ruff covers the neck and shoulders, but she has no male lion mane. Her eyes retain the fierce intelligence and predatory focus of her human form."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Athletic","Powerful","Feminine"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #0B0908"],"skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Golden amber"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Deep brown"],"wardrobe":"Regal attire\nCombat attire","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Thick majestic locs framing her face and falling down her back.","accessories":"Gold hair cuffs\nGold earrings\nGold jewelry","faceDetails":["Long face","Angular features","Confident chin"],"hairTexture":["4C"],"colorPalette":"Black — #0B0908\nTawny Gold\nDark Brown\nGold","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nGold","alternateForm":["Lioness/Dire Wolf Werebeast"],"clothingStyle":"Regal fantasy clothing with dark fabrics, gold detailing, and practical construction suited to movement and combat.","appearanceNotes":"Calliope''s human design emphasizes strength, femininity, and predatory confidence. Her thick 4C locs visually echo the powerful silhouette associated with her lioness heritage without becoming a literal mane.","outfitMaterials":["Cloth","Leather","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Fluid","Purposeful","Predatory","Commanding"],"signatureOutfit":"Regal dark fantasy attire with gold detailing, fitted for mobility and a commanding silhouette.","distinguishingFeatures":["Thick long locs","Confident smirk"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:37:15.885714+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:37:15.885714+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"King Kaelo''s bloodline","storyArc":"","backstory":"Calliope is one of King Kaelo''s seven children of Moonwood Vail. She developed a fierce, competitive temperament and carries herself with natural authority. Her movements and demeanor reflect the instincts of a patient, confident huntress.","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"","birthplace":"Moonwood Vail","psychology":["Strong-willed","Self-assured","Competitive"],"motivations":"","personality":["Confident","Fierce","Intelligent","Competitive","Authoritative","Fiery"],"voiceSpeech":["Confident","Commanding"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":null,"relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Cosmo\nGemma\nHuxleigh\nPeregrine\nVenny''Claire\nVenny''Macon","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Calliope is one of King Kaelo''s seven children. Her established siblings are Cosmo, Gemma, Huxleigh, Peregrine, Venny''Claire, and Venny''Macon."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"54d24391-3ed4-445b-8bfe-8dba238fc8e0","faction_record_id":null}','2026-09-25T19:17:21.37558+00:00');
