nky coat that seems to absorb light. Her smaller, compact body is built for speed, stealth, and acrobatic agility. Her only visible dire wolf trait is a silver patch of fur on her right hind leg. She moves with fluid grace and retains her playful curiosity and exceptional awareness."},"is_public":false,"appearance":{"build":["Compact","Lean","Agile"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Deep brown"],"grooming":"Natural","skinTone":["Rich warm brown"],"wardrobe":"Sleeveless linen dress\nLeather sandals","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Wild and untamed","accessories":"Braided leather waist cord\nLayered necklaces\nBeaded jewelry\nGold earrings\nGold bracelet","faceDetails":["High cheekbones","Small symmetrical nose","Youthful features"],"hairTexture":["4c","Dense"],"colorPalette":"Warm Brown\nBlack\nNatural Linen\nLeather Brown\nGold\nSilver","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Natural linen\nLeather brown\nGold","alternateForm":["Black Werepanther","Sudo Form"],"clothingStyle":"Light, practical clothing that allows unrestricted movement and suits the climate of Moonwood Vail.","appearanceNotes":"Venny''Claire closely mirrors Venny''Macon in facial structure, complexion, eyes, and hair. She is smaller and more compact than her brother, with a lighter frame suited to speed, agility, and acrobatic movement.","outfitMaterials":["Woven linen","Leather","Beads","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Relaxed posture","Fluid movement","Light-footed"],"signatureOutfit":"Simple sleeveless woven linen dress secured with a braided leather waist cord and worn with leather sandals.","distinguishingFeatures":["Large wide-set eyes"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:42:10.890987+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:27:28.811701+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"Dire Wolf and Werepanther","storyArc":"","backstory":"","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"